It is Friday.
It is only two o'clock.
My workday is already over.
I close my laptop and leave the office building.
Outside, I expect freezing rain.
I immediately open my umbrella.
But it is not raining.
I look up.
The heavy, dark clouds break apart.
Suddenly I see blue sky.
Jonas and the weather forecast are right!
It is going to be sunny.
The sun comes out.
The light is very bright.
It almost dazzles me.
It is a beautiful afternoon.
I do not go straight to the U-Bahn.
The weather is too beautiful for that.
Instead, I walk to a nearby canal.
